{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\Sch/U)_{fppf} \\times_{y, \\mathcal{Y}} \\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-lemma-identify-fibre-product}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-representable-by-space}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6b3380060d927cf24162f5a2f1a0b1254f112b335ba9d94d56084f7d943bf8c9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7bdec951eb4f560e0762625f88809aa21ed9e59259a33aa176c9e2f58bcc742a", "source_text": "This follows from the description of fibre categories of the <MATH_0001>-fibre products\n<MATH_0002> in\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0001>\ncombined with\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fb1e9ea9a4baedb514a8d06c6c41db27939615915f6324373ae097e68dc50746", "unit_id": "tag:02ZY:proof"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5e83bc3607ac96a1463600bd2940619c47c4c69c5a1dade86050601a99d0500f", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere are some lemmas about this notion that work in great generality.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c137328eec2f0794b84cc299daea5f190fa6dacc05cc66c42945a64860b923bd", "unit_id": "tag:04SX:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$2$", "MATH_0004": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{X}' \\ar[r] \\ar[d]_{f'} & \\mathcal{X} \\ar[d]^f \\\\\n\\mathcal{Y}' \\ar[r] & \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0005": "$1$", "MATH_0006": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$f'$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-representable-by-spaces-morphism-equivalent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:de61c5920a5b14bb01fb1e9cf53a22c2819148fcbbd7dba7ff553e91aca76504", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:38164bf131aa7bea2eb632e9d0114b5a9debff7a9ca114f1c6c3340417a61bac", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an object of <MATH_0002>.\nConsider a <MATH_0003>-commutative diagram\n<MATH_0004>\nof <MATH_0005>-morphisms of categories fibred in groupoids over\n<MATH_0006>.\nAssume the horizontal arrows are equivalences.\nThen <MATH_0007> is representable by algebraic spaces\nif and only if <MATH_0008> is representable by algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e2cf153672d2f54cf09660e4ae432aede641b78db666d77cdd77998ae8dd499e", "unit_id": "tag:0457:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c1dfe8a31f2d0830de4ce69f4f3e540dfc1c280c3aea5759e634d33125f76e6a", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:0457:proof"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$1$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$S$", "MATH_0009": "$1$", "MATH_0010": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-morphism-spaces-gives-representable-by-spaces}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a1ed231cb3ed375573c6e429c4417fe07150f982be3125adc00db02a25bd77cb", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0183870d4a3b261bfd392ed4b42b288ed4d34f0380df57c8f3d084a063b34da7", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an object of <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>\nbe a <MATH_0004>-morphism of categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0005>.\nIf <MATH_0006> and <MATH_0007> are representable by\nalgebraic spaces over <MATH_0008>, then the <MATH_0009>-morphism <MATH_0010>\nis representable by algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8291d6623acc59fd15adefcaaa27d9f1a92af5a2f91850395a03b2bac5a56ca8", "unit_id": "tag:02ZZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-lemma-fibre-product-spaces}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:86ec2eecd570d0c8a4f479624baf284069e51967c1f2fc353abd21054aea9915", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d21e89bacf1940689a1329649f6480f97203b38e5dd3c4393cf961f6fffd0774", "source_text": "Omitted. This relies only on the fact that\nthe category of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0001> has fibre products,\nsee Spaces, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f98e82d8f181625251a706d9c6bd0b3855eb5b9bdd6e29e90982705ec27e5517", "unit_id": "tag:02ZZ:proof"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$a : F \\to G$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$a' : \\mathcal{S}_F  \\to \\mathcal{S}_G$", "MATH_0006": "$a$", "MATH_0007": "$a'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{bootstrap-definition-morphism-representable-by-spaces}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-map-presheaves-representable-by-algebraic-spaces}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b8c93cd1f19227edb93f051daffa3dc6ba727bc256a0942b85fcf445199dd036", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1d008c8181f8071cb5e38ac2a0e6d5e7d1aa15168f9cfedda01b8a4e0e350bb6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an object of <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a map of presheaves of sets on <MATH_0004>.\nDenote <MATH_0005> the associated\nmap of categories fibred in sets.\nThen <MATH_0006> is representable by algebraic spaces (see\nBootstrap,\nDefinition <REF_0001>)\nif and only if <MATH_0007> is representable by algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f583daa344d72b1080d6d0bc543cc7e7bd88e3b4f1dd0ca757bcaca7c0fbd14a", "unit_id": "tag:0458:statement"}
